<title>UK: Estonian Investment Bank sets 30 mln mark 5-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Estonian Investment Bank sets 30 mln mark 5-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ESTONIAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    30 MLN MARK   SPREAD    *+80 BP    MATURITY  **20.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LIST	 UNLISTED  ISS PRICE  99.72     UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 20.DEC.99, 3M LIBOR PLUS 150 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE AT PAR ON 20.DEC.99</p>
<p>		PUT OPTION AT PAR ANY TIME UP TO 20.DEC.99 IF</p>
<p>		OWNERSHIP OF TOTAL OUTSTANDING SHARE CAPITAL OF</p>
<p>		ESTIB BY CURRENT SHAREHOLDERS OR NEW SHAREHOLDERS</p>
<p>		HAVING A RATING OF AT LEAST AA2 (MOODY'S INVESTORS</p>
<p>		SERVICE) OR AA (STANDARD &amp; POOR'S CORP) FALLS BELOW</p>
<p>		51 PCT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
